<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Caledonia Mining EPS view reduced.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Caledonia Mining EPS view reduced.</headline>
<text>
<p>--EVEREN Securities Inc said Friday it lowered its earnings-per-share estimates on Caledonia Mining Corp to reflect EVEREN's new gold price assumptions.</p>
<p>--It lowered its estimates to C$0.12 from C$0.38 for 1997, to C$0.29 from C$0.58 for 1998 and to C$0.38 from C$0.62 for 1999. EVEREN's gold price assumptions are US$365 per troy ounce for 1997, US$380 for 1998 and US$400 for 1999.</p>
<p>--Caledonia Mining was off 15/64 at 2-11/16.</p>
<p>		((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
